te falls out. Gayest ♥♥♥♥ I ever seen in a community. Maybe instead of commenting \"skill issue\", maybe get a ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ job and stop being a waste of space in society. None the less this game is still somewhat enjoyable to kill some time with friends, but probably not worth it for anyone that isn't a diehard fan.", "timestamp_created": 1765148716, "timestamp_updated": 1765261018, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.469849258661270142", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "212813124", "author": {"steamid": "76561198059370788", "personaname": "i tunnel e-daters", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gh0stpoop/", "num_games_owned": 147, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 3497, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2500, "last_played": 1777151269, "avatar": "3e77e55459e70b3f3ab3f5518e569c403e200542"}, "language": "english", "review": "no horses :/", "timestamp_created": 1765147938, "timestamp_updated": 1765743245, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212812936", "author": {"steamid": "76561199036674709", "personaname": "boop", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199036674709/", "num_games_owned": 39, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 47053, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 39131, "last_played": 1787453475, "avatar": "9c4d1995b0f991913b6156ca0455ea38c6ee59c5"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun", "timesta